### Check first
Open the [service metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics) and look for the last `up` sample for each previously observed scrape target. A fresh zero means that the Collector attempted the scrape and reported a failure.

### Likely causes
Target discovery changed, the Collector stopped running, or its export path dropped scrape results.

### Fix
Compare the discovered targets with the expected replicas and check the scraper and its export pipeline. Check the target endpoint separately when `up` is zero.

### Verify
The next delivered scrape result renews that target. After fifteen minutes absent, its observation expires. An empty result means there is no recent qualifying target.
